{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": "Per-player research in the Academy. A tech needs an Academy of `academyLevel` in the village that starts it and every tech in `requires`; its cost is paid by that village. One tech at a time per player. Effects add up across a player's techs and apply to all their villages: production.<resource>/production.all, outpostYield, storage (+share of capacity), buildTime/trainTime (negative = faster), upkeep (negative = less grain), attack.<family>/attack.all, defense.<family>/defense.all, homeDefense (defenders in their own village), lootTaken (negative = raiders take less), caravanSpeed, caravanCapacity, scoutSpeed, scoutSurvival (added to the survival chance). Seconds are game seconds (divided by world speed). A tech with requiresScroll can only be researched once the group has found that lore scroll (data/lore.json). Besides resources, a tech takes `researchPerSecond` research for every second it lasts, from what the player's Academies have brought in.",
  "researchPerSecond": 0.05,
  "branches": {
    "economy": "Economy",
    "military": "Military",
    "fortification": "Fortification",
    "scouting": "Scouting",
    "faith": "Faith"
  },
